{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: 20 Intelligence, 20 Wisdom, or 20 Charisma and the ability to cast at least one 5th level spell\n\nYou\u0027ve mastered the intricacies of spellcraft to great efficacy. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- When you cast a spell that affects a creature that you can see within range (including you), you can choose a number of them up to 1 + your spellcasting modifier. For the duration of the spell, the chosen creature(s) automatically succeed on their saving throws against the spell, and they take no damage if they would normally take half damage on a successful save. Additionally, all spells, including those with a range of \"self\" or \"touch\", gain a minimum range of 15 x your spellcasting modifier feet.\n\n- When you cast a spell that normally affects only a single creature, you can make it target a number of additional creatures equal to your spellcasting ability score\u0027s modifier, so long as they are within range of the spell. You can do this a number of times equal to half of your spellcasting ability score\u0027s modifier (rounded up), and regain expended uses upon taking a long rest.\n\n- When you cast a spell with a casting time of one action, you can use your bonus action to cast a different spell with a casting time of one action immediately after, ignoring the \"once per turn\" spell limitation. You can do this a number of times equal to half of your spellcasting ability score\u0027s modifier (rounded up) and regain expended uses upon taking a long rest.","level":1}],"id":"Customdb057a9c-5cbc-4a6d-8311-6e66a926abca","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Ascendant Spellcaster [SM] [LG]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}